              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["maintenance-requests", "{{maintenanceRequestId}}", "status"]
            },
            "description": "Update request status as the property owner (OWNER). OPEN -> IN_PROGRESS -> RESOLVED -> CLOSED. Notifies (+ emails) the tenant."
